@startuml
!include 00-style.puml

actor 管理员
actor 用户
participant "管理端页面" as AdminUI
participant "AgentController" as AC
participant "AgentOrchestrator" as AO
participant "RagMarkdownDocumentLoader" as Loader
participant "RagMarkdownChunker" as Chunker
participant "InMemoryRagIndex" as Index
participant "RagKnowledgeService" as RAG
participant "AiEdgeClient" as AEC
participant "AI 生成服务" as AIS

管理员 -> AdminUI : 上传课程资料/题库
AdminUI -> Loader : 触发文档装载
Loader -> Chunker : 切分 Markdown 文档
Chunker -> Index : 建立片段与向量索引
Index --> Loader : 索引完成

用户 -> AC : 发起知识问答
AC -> AO : chat/streamChat
AO -> RAG : retrieve(question)
RAG -> Index : search(queryVector, question)
Index --> RAG : 候选知识片段
RAG --> AO : Retrieval(results, READY)
AO -> AEC : 携带上下文请求生成
AEC -> AIS : 调用模型
AIS --> AEC : 生成回答
AEC --> AO : answer + citations
AO --> AC : 返回可追溯答案

@enduml
